 "MIT: required tests taken before Nov 30 (Early Action) or Dec 31 (Regular Action). Michigan: self-report score by Nov 1 for Early Action.": "MIT：所需考试须在11月30日（Early Action）或12月31日（Regular Action）之前参加。Michigan：Early Action 须在11月1日前自行报告成绩。",
 "Autumn of final school year": "最后一个学年的秋天",
