 "After admission": "被录取之后",
 "School enters you in SEVIS and issues Form I-20; pay SEVIS I-901 fee; attend visa interview. Student visa can be issued up to 365 days before the course starts; entry no earlier than 30 days before start.": "学校会在 SEVIS 系统中登记你并签发 I-20 表；缴纳 SEVIS I-901 费用；参加签证面谈。学生签证最早可在课程开始前365天签发；入境不得早于开学前30天。",
 "Per travel.state.gov: school issues Form I-20 via SEVIS, signed by student and school official and presented at the interview. SEVIS I-901 fee paid after acceptance (amount on ICE SEVIS site, not on this page). Visa can be issued up to 365 days before course start; entry limited to 30 days before. Interviews are generally required. The consular officer may ask how you will pay educational, living and travel costs. University of Michigan: most international students use F-1; I-20 issued after proof of full financial support.": "据 travel.state.gov：学校通过 SEVIS 签发 I-20 表，由学生和学校官员签字，并在面谈时出示。被录取后缴纳 SEVIS I-901 费用（金额在 ICE SEVIS 网站上，不在此页面）。签证最早可在课程开始前365天签发；入境限于开学前30天内。一般都需要面谈。领事官员可能会问你将如何支付学费、生活费和旅费。University of Michigan：大多数国际学生使用 F-1 签证；证明有完全资助后才签发 I-20。",
 "EducationUSA financial aid guidance": "EducationUSA 助学金指南",
