 "Example of the opposite policy: international students on temporary visas are not eligible for financial aid and are expected to pay full cost of attendance.": "相反政策的例子：持临时签证的国际学生没有资格获得助学金，需要支付全部就读费用。",
 "EducationUSA Egypt has a center at the U.S. Embassy in Cairo (contact by email form on the page; Facebook and Instagram listed). Also listed in search: EducationUSA at AMIDEAST Cairo and Alexandria (pages not opened).": "EducationUSA Egypt 在开罗的美国大使馆设有中心（通过页面上的电子邮件表单联系；列有 Facebook 和 Instagram）。搜索结果中还列出了开罗和亚历山大的 AMIDEAST 的 EducationUSA（页面未打开）。",
