 "EducationUSA: 5 steps": "EducationUSA：5个步骤",
 "EducationUSA Egypt (US Embassy Cairo)": "EducationUSA Egypt（美国驻开罗大使馆）",
 "US Dept of State student visa": "美国国务院学生签证",
 "Common App first-year": "Common App 一年级新生申请",
