 "Official US government scholarships for international undergraduates (none identified; Fulbright etc. not checked)": "美国政府为国际本科生提供的官方奖学金（没有找到；Fulbright 等未检查）",
 "Neutral official description of holistic review": "对综合评估（holistic review）的中立官方说明",
 "Undergraduate applications to UK universities are made through UCAS. Each university sets its own entry requirements, so Egyptian applicants must check every course. Universities differ sharply on Thanaweya Amma: Oxford lists it as 'Not accepted', Cambridge says it alone is unlikely to be competitive, and Manchester accepts it only for a foundation year first. Note: for 2027 entry the UCAS equal-consideration dates are 15 October 2026 and 13 January 2027 (not 14/15 January).": "英国本科申请通过 UCAS 提交。每所大学自己制定入学要求，所以埃及申请者必须逐个核对每门课程。各大学对 Thanaweya Amma 的态度差别很大：Oxford 列为“不接受”，Cambridge 说仅凭它不太可能有竞争力，Manchester 只接受它先读预科年（foundation year）。注意：2027年入学的 UCAS 平等考虑日期是2026年10月15日和2027年1月13日（不是1月14/15日）。",
 "Apply online via UCAS: up to five choices for a fee of £34.50 for 2027 entry (Oxford and Cambridge: usually only one of the two; medicine/dentistry/veterinary: max four such courses). Application has 13 sections including a 4,000-character personal statement and a reference from someone who is not a family member or friend. Qualifications must be entered with titles as on the certificate. International applicants can enter English test results and, for 2027 entry, upload English certificates and passport evidence through a UCAS document upload service. Universities decide offers; many continue to accept international applications after January.": "通过 UCAS 在线申请：2027年入学最多可填五个志愿，费用为34.50英镑（Oxford 和 Cambridge：两者通常只能选一个；医学/牙医/兽医：这类课程最多四个）。申请表有13个部分，包括一份4,000字符的个人陈述和一封由非家人、非朋友的人写的推荐信。资历要按证书上的名称填写。国际申请者可以填写英语考试成绩；2027年入学还可以通过 UCAS 文件上传服务上传英语证书和护照证明。录取决定由大学做出；许多大学在1月之后仍接受国际申请。",
 "None of the UCAS pages opened describe SAT or ACT as a general requirement for UK undergraduate entry. Individual universities may mention them only for specific applicant groups (Cambridge mentions SAT/ACT with AP tests for China and the US sections; Oxford's page mentions SAT/AP for Canada). For Egyptian applicants no SAT/ACT requirement was found on pages opened. Check each university.": "所打开的 UCAS 页面都没有把 SAT 或 ACT 说成是英国本科入学的一般要求。个别大学可能只对特定申请群体提到它们（Cambridge 在中国和美国部分提到 SAT/ACT 加 AP 考试；Oxford 的页面在加拿大部分提到 SAT/AP）。对埃及申请者，在所打开的页面上没有找到 SAT/ACT 要求。请逐个大学核对。",
 "For Egypt, lists the Thanaweya Amma/Al-Azhar certificate and Egyptian STEM Diploma as needing further study (examples given: A Levels, IB, or 5+ AP tests at score 5 with an overall General Secondary School Certificate score of at least 95%). SAT/ACT is mentioned only in other country sections.": "对于埃及，列出 Thanaweya Amma/Al-Azhar 证书和埃及 STEM Diploma 需要进一步学习（举例：A Levels、IB，或5门及以上 AP 考试且成绩为5，同时 General Secondary School Certificate 总分至少95%）。SAT/ACT 只在其他国家部分被提到。",
 "Some courses require an admissions test; this varies by university and course. Examples for the 2026-27 cycle at Oxford: UCAT (Medicine), LNAT (Law), TMUA (Computer Science, Mathematics), ESAT (e.g. Engineering Science, Physics, Biomedical Sciences), TARA (e.g. Philosophy, Politics and Economics). Some tests are taken before the UCAS deadline.": "有些课程需要入学考试；因大学和课程而异。2026-27申请季 Oxford 的例子：UCAT（医学）、LNAT（法律）、TMUA（计算机科学、数学）、ESAT（如工程科学、物理、生物医学科学）、TARA（如哲学、政治与经济）。有些考试要在 UCAS 截止日期之前参加。",
 "UAT-UK (ESAT/TMUA/TARA) October sitting: test booking closed 28 Sep 2026; tests 12-16 Oct 2026; results 16 Nov 2026. UCAT and LNAT run through Pearson.": "UAT-UK（ESAT/TMUA/TARA）十月考季：考试报名已于2026年9月28日截止；考试时间为2026年10月12-16日；成绩公布日期为2026年11月16日。UCAT 和 LNAT 通过 Pearson 举行。",
