 "UCAT 2026 registration and booking is closed (booking deadline 16 Sep 2026; last test day 24 Sep 2026; UCAS deadline 15 Oct 2026). The page does not state an entry year; instructions for UCAT 2027 will be published later. Whether Egypt test centres exist was not verified.": "UCAT 2026的报名和预约已经关闭（预约截止日期为2026年9月16日；最后考试日为2026年9月24日；UCAS 截止日期为2026年10月15日）。页面没有写明入学年份；UCAT 2027的说明将在以后公布。埃及是否有考点没有核实。",
 "The level needed varies by university. Students who need a Student visa may need a test approved by UKVI. UCAS lists IELTS, TOEFL, Trinity ISE, PTE, and Cambridge C1 Advanced/C2 Proficiency as accepted tests, with IELTS or TOEFL numbers enterable in the application.": "所需水平因大学而异。需要申请 Student 签证的学生可能需要参加 UKVI 认可的考试。UCAS 列出的认可考试有 IELTS、TOEFL、Trinity ISE、PTE，以及 Cambridge C1 Advanced/C2 Proficiency，其中 IELTS 或 TOEFL 的分数可以填入申请表。",
 "IELTS Academic overall 7.5 with at least 7.0 in each component (IELTS Online not accepted); TOEFL iBT 110 with minimums L22/R24/S25/W24; TOEFL taken from 21 Jan 2026 not accepted. Oxford confirms English on the CAS, so no extra English evidence is needed for the visa.": "IELTS Academic 总分7.5，每个单项至少7.0（不接受 IELTS Online）；TOEFL iBT 110，单项最低 听力22/阅读24/口语25/写作24；2026年1月21日起参加的 TOEFL 不被接受。Oxford 确认英语成绩会写在 CAS 上，所以签证不需要额外的英语证明。",
 "All applicants must show English proficiency; UKVI requires at least B2; individual Schools may set higher levels and some need the score before applying. IGCSE/O-level English may be considered in certain circumstances. Exact scores per course were not on the page.": "所有申请者都必须证明英语水平；UKVI 要求至少 B2；各学院可能设更高的要求，有些要求在申请前就提交成绩。IGCSE/O-level 英语在某些情况下可能会被考虑。每门课程的具体分数页面上没有写。",
 "Qualifications and grades entered in UCAS": "在 UCAS 中填写的资历和成绩",
